  "finding": {
    "positive": "The source-scoped native-qudit gate-count advantage has substantial conditional headroom under a simple independent-entangler survival proxy. For the d=3 full-gauge 26-vs-90 comparison, if the one-hot-qubit entangler success is 0.99, the native-qudit break-even success is about 0.92077 in this proxy.",
